      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아하하! 잔뜩 있으니 얼마든지 드세요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あはは！たっぷりあるからどうぞお召し上がりください！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_INDEPENDENT_VAGABOND_01",
