      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네! 키우고 싶은 농작물이 있어서요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "はい！育てたい農作物があるんです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 36,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_INDEPENDENT_VAGABOND_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "주변을 둘러보던 중이었어요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "周りを見回していたところでした。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 38,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_INDEPENDENT_VAGABOND_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
